<title>SOUTH AFRICA: DEUTSCHE MORGAN GRENFELL RANKED NO 1 IN S.AFRICA.</title>
<headline>DEUTSCHE MORGAN GRENFELL RANKED NO 1 IN S.AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockbrokers Deutsche Morgan</p>
<p>Grenfell were ranked as the best overall and equities firm in</p>
<p>South Africa in the Financial Mail's annual review of</p>
<p>stockbroking firms.</p>
<p>In the overall and equities sections, Fleming Martin was</p>
<p>ranked second and BOE Natwest Securities third.</p>
<p>OVERALL RANKINGS</p>
<p>1. Deutsche Morgan Grenfell</p>
<p>2. Fleming Martin</p>
<p>3. BOE Natwest Securities</p>
<p>4. UBS Securities</p>
<p>5. SBC Warburg</p>
<p>6. Simpson McKie James Capel</p>
<p>7. Smith Borkum Hare</p>
<p>8. Investec Securities</p>
<p>9. Standard Equities</p>
<p>10. Barnard Jacobs Mellet &amp; Co</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482-1003</p>
</text>
